  "definition": {
    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 8,
    "title": "Use common verb-object expressions",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-verb-object-basic-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Use common verb-object expressions",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Some familiar expressions contain a verb and its object. A suitable modifier goes before that object; do not add another object after the whole expression. A known verb-object expression can also allow an internal modifier: 睡一个好觉 puts the quantity and adjective before the object 觉, not after the whole 睡觉. This is licensed separation of the introduced word, not a new independent meaning for 觉.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我睡觉。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ shuìjiào 。",
                "meaning": "I sleep.",
                "audio": "2480e35593dc2b59ef6767ebc1c0cf5222af1272ed027ba1adf941f2a4d6c9f2"
              },
              {
                "text": "我看你的书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ kàn nǐ de shū 。",
                "meaning": "I read your book.",
                "audio": "28d8254369a595fa44445726fd522a39b4eaddc4f55a8756b46c365c0f1f6737"
              },
              {
                "text": "我下班。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xiàbān 。",
                "meaning": "I finish work.",
                "audio": "a808285c8a2dee4d3a552ff80f5d637ff9625780d4f552552b8ac2376cf767dc"
              },
              {
                "text": "我想睡一个好觉。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng shuì yī gè hǎo jiào 。",
                "meaning": "I want to have a good sleep.",
                "audio": "ada217ca8a828546f413f5869aee2fe7af53edc15c4e43f77d2eb40c30e10bec"
              }
            ]
          },
